         <div class="menu-ul-ftr">
            <ul id="menu-academics-1" class="" itemscope itemtype="http://www.schema.org/SiteNavigationElement"><li  class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-1633 nav-item"><a itemprop="url" href="https://www.abesit.in/academic-calendar/">Academic Calendar</a></li>
<li  class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-14936 nav-item"><a itemprop="url" href="https://www.abesit.in/faculty-appreciation-letters/">Faculty Appreciation</a></li>
<li  class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-491 nav-item"><a itemprop="url" href="https://www.abesit.in/faculty/">Faculty</a></li>
